{"productId": "9931b24b-21e7-4427-9241-2384761bc026", "modelName": "P365-380 Rose", "modelDescription": "The Rose P365 kit includes a special edition P365 pistol in either 9mm or .380, a custom ROSE Vaultek lockable storage case, and instant access to a complete step-by-step ROSE video training series that allows you to learn at your own pace, along with a ROSE online community to help encourage and inspire you with help and support as you continue to grow as a more confident and comfortable shooter. ROSE is based on Lena\u2019s years of experience as a competitor and in teaching women at every skill level, all over the country. ROSE has been developed to be a complete system, that\u2019s easy to understand, easy to learn, and easy to use.  The ROSE program will take you step-by-step through the process from your first time holding a pistol all the way to your first time at a range. And ROSE is also a community of women, coming together to help and encourage each other. To share their stories and learn from one another.   ROSE gets you everything you need to get started, a full online training course to get you comfortable and ready for your first time at a range, and an online community to share your experiences and learn from other women just like you.", "manufacturerName": "Sig Sauer", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "378ac3ed-ea0f-4658-a101-17465afd5f31", "description": "Sig Sauer, P365-380 ROSE, Semi Automatic, 380 ACP, 3.1\" Barrel, Black Nitron Finish, Rose Gold Accents, ROMEO-RS Sight, Night Sights, Manual Safety, 10 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/68292756-b7dc-464c-8d0e-05637fb1cdda", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/5b6c9ed2-10a7-4780-a1d8-1bade945ac29", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b2780d68-88b9-4b8a-a9eb-4b95cd01e61f", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d4bc1268-9eaf-49ad-a690-9c941098f55a", "https://main-images.g